{"request_id":"sha256:293c6db491315741a81b9d2becf4ead21b95ae3c0dfebcb32e9a0e32120db919","units":[{"unit_id":"sha256:23c828273501990f075abe76dc8bae989c11d13673b0832f43e4cdf364b106af","reviewed":true,"findings":[{"kind":"CAPACITY_QUALITATIVE","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"NATIVE_FACT","source_index":449}],"reason":"Enphase Energy, Inc. discloses the Inflation Reduction Act's Advanced Manufacturing Production Tax Credit (AMPTC) for microinverters at 11 cents per alternating current watt, applicable to microinverters manufactured in the United States and sold to customers, with the credit decreasing by 25% each year beginning in 2030 and ending after 2032. This is a qualitative statement about a production-related tax credit and its microinverter scope, not a reported production quantity or available manufacturing capacity figure."},{"kind":"MONETARY_CREDIT_CAPACITY","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"NATIVE_FACT","source_index":450},{"kind":"NATIVE_FACT","source_index":451}],"reason":"Enphase Energy, Inc. reports AMPTC income tax payable benefit amounts of $238.7 million as of December 31, 2025 and $157.5 million as of December 31, 2024. These are monetary tax credit balances denominated in USD, not physical production or manufacturing capacity."}],"unresolved":[],"calculation_limits":["TARGET_CURRENT_PRODUCTION_NOT_PRESENT_IN_THIS_UNIT","TARGET_CURRENT_CAPACITY_NOT_PRESENT_IN_THIS_UNIT"]}]}